    <statement><p>Let <m>f(x) = 5 x + 3</m> and <m>g(x) = 4 x^2 + 2 x</m>.
Match the functions obtained by composition with the letters labeling their algebraically equivalent expressions.</p>
<p>You must get all of the answers correct to receive credit.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>g \circ g</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f \circ f</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>f \circ g</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>g \circ f</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
<p><ol label="A.">
<li>
<p><m>20 x^2 + 10 x + 3</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>25 x + 18</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>64 x^4 + 64 x^3 + 24 x^2 + 4 x</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>100 x^2 + 130 x + 42</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
